    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beelti lafa Kanaani haga qarale ira hammaatte, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duuba eegi worri Yakobo mid'aani Misiri galateeni kaani nyaate fit'e, Yakobooni waan ilmaani isaatini jed'e, Beena, dachaa, mid'aani diqo toko ammalle nuu bita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Yudaani waan jed'eeni, Namichi aka jaba nuti d'aame waan nuuni jed'e, Oboleesa keesaniini d'uftani male, fuula kiyya dura imbahiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo atini oboleesa keenna nu gula ergite, nu deemne sagale sii binna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo didde, nu iyyaanuyu, wonti akanatiifi namichi waan nuuni jed'e, Oboleesa keesaniini d'uftani male, fuula kiyya dura imbahiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni waan jed'eeni, Isani maafi namichaani, Oboleesa d'ibi qamna jettani na gaargalchitani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri waan jed'eeni, Namichi waan worra keenna gaafate lakisu dide. Abbaani keesani inuma jira? Oboleesa d'ibi qabdu? nuuni jed'e. Nu gaafi isa gula akasi jenneeni. Nu akamiini beena, aka inni, Oboleesa keesaniini koota nuuni jed'u?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yudaani waan abbaani jed'e, Gurba na gula ergi, ammuma tana yaana, aka nu nami diqafi guddaani tokoleeni beelaani indoone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dua jireenni isaa gubbaa tiyya. Yo anini nagayaani sii galche si dura ind'aabiini, haga jiru jireennale wollaali ha kiyya tahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato akana turu baanne, sila maro lamale ya yaane dachaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbaani waan worrani jed'e, Yo akasi male intaatu jettani, waan lafti teenna baaftu dansa ch'ufa, ta aka hampefa, dammafa, qumbifa, waan aka ogomdifa qolaatifa guura, namicha guddaa geesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle beese tana male, beese subba keesati isanii deebisani taanile fuud'a, hegeri wollaalafi isanii deebisani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboleesa keesani fud'ad'a, beena yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi Guddaani namicha isani naasisinna, aka inni Benjaminifi oboleesa keesani kaani gadi deebisu. Yo ilmaani tiyya d'abu male, ha d'abuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri waan namichaa geesani sunifi beese mid'aaniini bitatani haga duri kaani ira maro lama fuud'ani, Benjaminile woliini kaani, lafa Misiri d'aqani, fuula Yusufu dura d'ufani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni Benjamini worra birati arge jennaani waan hojattu isaatini jed'e, Worra kana mana kiyya geesa, arra saa jaa sagale woliini nyaanna, tanaafi hori qala, waan ch'ufa kurfeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojattuuni taani aka iti himani kaani guute worra mana Yusufuu geesite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato manati geesanu, worri nahe waan jed'e, Waan armaani nu d'ufanifi maro beese subba keenna keesati deebisanifi, amma hegeri maruma toko nu had'ani harrele teenna guuratani tisse nu tolfatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba fulla balbala mana isaa gahani jennaani waan nama huji mana suniti matatiini jed'ani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aabbo, nu qara sagale binna jenne arma d'umne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba karaati bulti miha hiikhanne jennaani nu namu beese qara mid'aaniini bitanne taani afaani subba keennati argine, beeseeni suni tokochi qubaleeni inhamne, amma layu sitiini d'umne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle beese sagaleeni bitannu d'ibiini ya d'umne. Nama beese teenna nuu deebise nu imbeennu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan jed'eeni, Iyyaaliina, insodaatina, Waaqi keesani, Waaqi abba keesani, beese teesani hegeri subba keesaniti deebise. Anini ufi tiyya beese teesani ya fud'ad'e jed'e, Simeoni worratiini d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba inni worra kaani mana Yusufutiini d'ufe bisaani worri miila d'iqatu kenneefi harrele worrale mid'aani kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba worri waan Yusufu d'ufeeni kaani, aka saa jaa hojja inni d'ufu iti kennu, kurfeese. Wonti akanatiifi aka worri sagale isa woliini nyaatu ya iti himani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni gale jennaani waan d'ufaninifi kaani kurfeesani itiini d'ufani durati gadi jejed'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni nagaya worra fuud'e waan jed'eeni, Jaarsi abba keesani ka isani baantani kaani jira? Inni baraa fayyaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aabbo, abbaani keenna inuma jira, baraa fayyaa jed'ani durati gajejed'ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
